  "bodyHash": "65f6f66b25523d54",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><strong>簡介</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>💎你喜歡尋找寶藏</strong><strong>嗎？💎</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🧭想讓你的探索更加多變嗎？🧭</strong></p>\n<p><strong>⚔️把它加入你的模組包吧！⚔️</strong></p>\n<h2>功能特色&nbsp;</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>探索並發現<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超過 100 種建築結構</strong></span>，從小型遺跡到複雜的地下城應有盡有</li>\n<li>這些結構擁有<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>多種變化</strong></span>，並由<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超過 850 個拼圖結構組件</strong></span>構成</li>\n<li>大部分結構內都設有<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>藏寶箱，內含獨特的戰利品表與自訂道具</strong></span></li>\n<li>蒐集<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>235 種自訂道具</strong></span>，包含<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>飾品（Curios）</strong></span>與<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特殊武器</strong></span></li>\n<li>尋找並蒐集<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超過 90 種自訂方塊</strong></span>來裝飾你的基地</li>\n<li>尋找並擊敗<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超過 30 隻獨一無二的動態生物，包含首領級怪物</strong></span></li>\n<li>此模組<strong>支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>完全相容</strong></span>於眾多<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>生物群系模組</strong></span>（列表見下方）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>需求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>設定</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如果你正在製作包含多種結構模組的模組包，且希望「Piglet Structures」的結構出現頻率大幅降低，請改用此版本：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglet-structures-modpack-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglet-structures-modpack-edition</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>維基</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpiglet-structures.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPiglet_Structures_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://piglet-structures.fandom.com/wiki/Piglet_Structures_Wiki</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<p>透過精確的生物群系標籤，本模組的結構與以下生物群系模組完全相容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>如需查看已標記的生物群系清單，請點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpiglet-structures.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBiome_tags\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>贊助</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>如果你想支持我，並幫助我開發更多模組，歡迎請我喝杯咖啡……或是水果冰沙、披薩 ;D……或者隨着我當下最想吃的東西 xDD</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flordddiamond\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/lordddiamond</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>模組包</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>沒錯，你&nbsp;<strong>可以</strong>在模組包中使用它！&nbsp;😇</li>\n<li>關於模組內容與標籤的詳細資訊，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpiglet-structures.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPiglet_Structures_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>查看。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fxhsx3c/Neutral-Overworld-Ancient-Skeleton-Fortress-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nLwtbpQ/Neutral-Overworld-Ancient-Skeleton-Fortress-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bd0bH1H/Plains-Mine-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KX83jPL/Birch-Forest-Gnome-Mansion-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9t3w0YP/Birch-Forest-Gnome-Mansion-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/D8YqmBH/Nether-Wasteland-Ancient-Portal-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ByCrLgS/2024-01-22-20-14-57.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0VdZwV0/2024-01-22-17-11-33.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qmtfCn4/2024-05-01-18-18-37.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9bcj9W5/Piglet-Structures-Mobs-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SVpH7sC/Soulsand-Valley-Bone-House-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bsGh22J/2024-01-22-17-21-34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1481\" height=\"833\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fpiglet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1404348/description_1eddde9a-fbdb-46c8-b853-20cd883a0110.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
